      "writtenOn": "2026-10-06T07:08:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While the FD is in update mode it rejects RequestUpdate with ALREADY_IN_UPDATE_MODE, so any retry or follow-up update of that device fails until FD_T1 expires. Here the UA knows the update is over, so it should end it with CancelUpdate. I\u0027ve added this to the commit message.",
      "parentUuid": "3e0a883e_e1c59829",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 13
