        "id": 1000056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-06T05:55:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel like this needs to be done in the caller, OR we need some sort of RAII-like behavior than adding this in all error paths and also remembering to do this in yet to be added error paths.",
      "revId": "5f315824e6257caf50b993f46fa60e9c546bf201",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
