        "id": 1002605
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-06T07:08:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done — moved it to the caller. passCompTable() and updateComponent() now return bool, and the registerRequest callback calls failAndCancelUpdate() once when a handler returns false. Existing and future error paths only need to return false. A declined component still returns true and moves on to the next one. I also added a unit test for the contract.",
      "parentUuid": "40f2bfd6_480a30b1",
      "revId": "5f315824e6257caf50b993f46fa60e9c546bf201",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
